#30802
Barred Passage~
   The passage ends abruptly here, at a shimmering force field, which blocks
the tunnel northwards.  Beyond it you can see a junction, with several passages
leading deeper into the sewers, though you cannot see any way past this
particular obstacle.  Deep claw marks on the wall indicate that something else
is here, however, perhaps a guardian or a creature trapped and confused like
you?    
