#30875
Sandy Passage~
The walls in this section bear simple murals, two dimensional representations
of women being ravaged by jackal-headed men of immense proportions, and
giving issue to vile half-human half-canine hybrids that rampage wantonly
through the streets of some unknown city. The name Keraptis appears in several
places around the walls. You remember hearing Keraptis was a wicked man, and 
had done many wicked deeds in his past. He is also apparently much older than 
you at first realized, several images of a laughing man clad in robes of 
crimson dominate many of the murals, a figure you can only assume to be the 
mad mage himself.
~
